TI  - Ultrastretchable freezing-tolerant organohydrogels for health monitoring and triboelectric nanogenerator-based gesture recognition
T2  - NANO ENERGY
LA  - English
KW  - NaCl-based organohydrogel
KW  - Triboelectric nanogenerator
KW  - Ultrastretchable
