TI  - An Innovative Random-Forest-Based Model to Assess the Health Impacts of Regular Commuting Using Non-Invasive Wearable Sensors
T2  - SENSORS
LA  - English
KW  - EEG sensors
KW  - stress assessment
KW  - blood pressure
KW  - commuting
KW  - wearable sensors
KW  - predictive models
KW  - DIASTOLIC BLOOD-PRESSURE
