TI  - A flexible SP/PVA conductive hydrogel-based triboelectric nanogenerator for energy harvesting and motion monitoring in basketball
T2  - MICROSYSTEM TECHNOLOGIES-MICRO-AND NANOSYSTEMS-INFORMATION STORAGE AND PROCESSING SYSTEMS
LA  - English
