TI  - A self-powered PVA-based flexible humidity sensor with humidity-related voltage output for multifunctional applications
T2  - COLLOIDS AND SURFACES A-PHYSICOCHEMICAL AND ENGINEERING ASPECTS
LA  - English
KW  - Self -powered
KW  - Humidity sensor
KW  - PVA-based
