TI  - Effects of a patient-centered digital health intervention in patients referred to cardiac rehabilitation: the Smart HEART clinical trial
T2  - BMC CARDIOVASCULAR DISORDERS
LA  - English
KW  - Digital technology
KW  - Cardiac rehabilitation
KW  - Exercise therapy patient-centered care
KW  - Pragmatic clinical trial
