TI  - Skin-Inspired Ultrafast Self-Healing Wearable Patch with Hybrid Cooling for Comfortable and Durable Electromyographic Monitoring
T2  - ADVANCED MATERIALS TECHNOLOGIES
LA  - English
KW  - electrophysiology signal detection
KW  - human-machine interaction
KW  - hydrogel
KW  - passive cooling
