TI  - A nanocomposite hydrogel loaded with Ag nanoparticles reduced by aloe vera polysaccharides as an antimicrobial multifunctional sensor
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF BIOLOGICAL MACROMOLECULES
