TI  - BEND SENSORS BASED ON NANOCELLULOSE AND POLYVINYL ALCOHOL BIONANOCOMPOSITES FOR WEARABLE ELECTRONICS
T2  - SCIENCE AND INNOVATION
LA  - English
KW  - bend sensor
KW  - nanocellulose
KW  - PVA
KW  - bionanocomposite
KW  - biodegradability
