TI  - An ideographic study into physiology, alcohol craving and lapses during one hundred days of daily life monitoring
T2  - ADDICTIVE BEHAVIORS REPORTS
LA  - English
KW  - Alcohol craving
KW  - Cardiovascular activity
KW  - Electrodermal activity
KW  - Ecological momentary assessment
KW  - ECOLOGICAL MOMENTARY ASSESSMENT
KW  - HEART-RATE-VARIABILITY
KW  - CUE-REACTIVITY
KW  - REAL-TIME
KW  - PROCESSING MODEL
KW  - ASSESSMENT EMA
KW  - RELAPSE
KW  - DRINKING
