AB  - This paper is close contacted to the information systems construction of Jinan Tobacco Logistics Distribution Center. The demand of modem logistics distribution system is analyzed, and the Delivery System based on GIS/GPS is proposed. The current situation, tendency and application of the technologies for vehicle locating, vehicle route planning, communication and automated driving are emphasized.
