TI  - The Comparative Effectiveness of Mobile Phone Interventions in Improving Health Outcomes: Meta-Analytic Review
T2  - JMIR MHEALTH AND UHEALTH
LA  - English
KW  - meta-analysis
KW  - mobile phones
KW  - mHealth
KW  - intervention study
KW  - RANDOMIZED CONTROLLED-TRIAL
KW  - SHORT MESSAGE SERVICE
KW  - INCREASE PHYSICAL-ACTIVITY
