TI  - Mood state and gambling: Using mobile telephones to track emotions
T2  - BRITISH JOURNAL OF PSYCHOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - INTERACTIVE VOICE RESPONSE
KW  - SENSATION-SEEKING
