TI  - Exploring multiple drug use by integrating mobile health and qualitative mapping methods-An individual case study
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF DRUG POLICY
LA  - English
KW  - polydrug use
KW  - substance use
KW  - social determinants of health
KW  - sexual and gender minorites
