TI  - A Smart Wristband Integrated with an IoT-Based Alarming System for Real-Time Sweat Alcohol Monitoring
T2  - SENSORS
LA  - English
KW  - noninvasive sweat alcohol monitoring
KW  - metal oxide (MOX) gas sensor
KW  - wearable sensor
