TI  - Anti-bacterial, anti-freezing starch/ionic liquid/PVA ion-conductive hydrogel with high performance for multi-stimulation sensitive responsive sensors
T2  - CHEMICAL ENGINEERING JOURNAL
LA  - English
KW  - Ionic liquid
KW  - Ionic hydrogel
KW  - Wearable sensors
