TI  - Polyvinyl alcohol wrapped multiwall carbon nanotube (MWCNTs) network on fabrics for wearable room temperature ethanol sensor
T2  - SENSORS AND ACTUATORS B-CHEMICAL
LA  - English
KW  - MWCNTs
