TI  - Availability of medical cannabis dispensaries and cannabis abuse/dependence-related hospitalizations in California
T2  - ADDICTION
LA  - English
KW  - Cannabis abuse
KW  - cannabis dependence
KW  - cannabis use disorder
KW  - hospital discharge data
KW  - medical cannabis dispensaries
