TI  - What proportion of people who use cannabis in Germany have spoken with their general practitioner about their consumption? A repeated cross-sectional representative population survey
T2  - JOURNAL OF CANNABIS RESEARCH
LA  - English
KW  - Cannabis
KW  - Primary care
KW  - General practice
KW  - Family medicine
