TI  - A Context-Sensing Mobile Phone App (Q Sense) for Smoking Cessation: A Mixed-Methods Study
T2  - JMIR MHEALTH AND UHEALTH
LA  - English
KW  - mobile phone app
KW  - smoking cessation
KW  - context sensing
KW  - tailoring
