TI  - Short term follow-up of 198 IV heroin users by motivated General Practitioners
T2  - REVUE D EPIDEMIOLOGIE ET DE SANTE PUBLIQUE
LA  - French
KW  - drug addiction
KW  - general practitioners
KW  - treatments
