TI  - Perceived risks and amelioration of harm in research using mobile technology to support antiretroviral therapy adherence in the context of methamphetamine use: a focus group study among minorities living with HIV
T2  - HARM REDUCTION JOURNAL
LA  - English
KW  - HIV
KW  - ART adherence
KW  - Methamphetamine
KW  - mHealth
KW  - Participatory design
KW  - Bioethics
