TI  - Somatic health among heroin addicts before and during opioid maintenance treatment:: a retrospective cohort study
T2  - BMC PUBLIC HEALTH
LA  - English
KW  - INJECTING DRUG-USERS
KW  - QUALITY-OF-LIFE
KW  - GENERAL-POPULATION
KW  - VIRUS-INFECTION
KW  - OPIATE USERS
