TI  - Draining the tobacco swamps: Shaping the built environment to reduce tobacco retailer proximity to residents in 30 big US cities
T2  - HEALTH & PLACE
LA  - English
KW  - Tobacco retailer density
KW  - Tobacco retailer proximity
KW  - Retail tobacco policy
KW  - SMOKING
