TI  - Overexpression of GPS and FPS from Chrysanthemum indicum var. aromaticum resulted in modified trichome formation and terpenoid biosynthesis in tobacco
T2  - PLANT GROWTH REGULATION
LA  - English
KW  - Chrysanthemum
