TI  - Identifying narco-trafficking landing zones using satellite imagery and geospatial indicators in Costa Rica
T2  - GEOJOURNAL
LA  - English
KW  - Narco-Trafficking
KW  - Unreported and unregulated boats (UUBs)
KW  - Cocaine supply chain
KW  - Illicit economies
