TI  - National addictions vigilance intervention and prevention program (NAVIPPRO™): a real-time, product-specific, public health surveillance system for monitoring prescription drug abuse
T2  - PHARMACOEPIDEMIOLOGY AND DRUG SAFETY
LA  - English
