AB  - With the rapid development of electronics, control and communications, the increasing number of elderly and infirm people living alone in their own homes is creating the need for new personal emergency response systems based on public telephones and cable networks. A platform based on global system for mobile communications (GSM) short message and global positioning system (GPS) global positioning system self-alarm device is designed, which uses a 32-bit microcontroller STM32F103RB as a host computer, wireless GSM module as a wireless communications platform, GPS module as a positioning platform, in addition to adding a digital temperature sensor DS18B20 and smoke sensors as environmental data acquisition devices. This article gives design ideas and solutions of short message platform based on self-alarm systems which are composed of main control module, communication networks, sensor module, text messaging module and an interface circuit. The alarm device has a simple hardware structure and cost advantages, and the modular program structure makes the expansion of the system functionality very convenient. It provides a new direction in the relevant research fields.
