TI  - GPs' prescription patterns, experience, and attitudes towards medicinal cannabis-a nationwide survey at the early stage of the Danish test scheme
T2  - BMC PRIMARY CARE
LA  - English
KW  - Medical cannabis
KW  - General practitioner
KW  - Prescription
