TI  - Project phoenix: Pilot randomized controlled trial of a smartphone-delivered intervention for people who are not ready to quit smoking
T2  - DRUG AND ALCOHOL DEPENDENCE
LA  - English
KW  - Ecological momentary assessment
KW  - Just in time adaptive intervention
KW  - Mobile health
