TI  - Factors associated with rates of tobacco treatment delivery by General Practitioners in Greece: Missed opportunities for prevention?
T2  - TOBACCO INDUCED DISEASES
LA  - English
KW  - tobacco treatment delivery
KW  - factors
KW  - primary health care
