TI  - Smoking cessation intervention in Australian general practice: a secondary analysis of a duster randomised controlled trial
T2  - BRITISH JOURNAL OF GENERAL PRACTICE
LA  - English
KW  - general practicle
KW  - smoking cessation
KW  - tobacco use
KW  - OBSTRUCTIVE PULMONARY-DISEASE
KW  - SMOKERS
KW  - ADVICE
