AB  - Nature is unpredictable. The unconventional use of natural resources causes natural disasters like Volcanic Eruptions, Earthquakes that determine the more significant destruction in the social and mental lives of living beings. To predict, aware every human being the natural liabilities in this world to be conscious and have better rehabilitation centers. Uncertainty of natural disasters, A novel practical approach has been proposed with the base concept of the Internet of things. The system will generate a large amount of raw data, which helps prepare for the preparedness of rehabilitation and impact. The proposed system consists of a Global Positioning System Neo 6M, a Node Micro Controller Unit chip, a Message Queue-135 Air Quality sensor, an LM35 Temperature Sensor, Gyro Sensor 61 Gyroscope module, Global Positioning Neo 6M module. The Gyro Sensor-61 Gyroscope module track movements of the ground. The Message Queue 135 sensors watch out for the Gas and Smoke coming out from the volcano, while the Linear Monotholic Series 35 sensor checks if there is a rise in the surface temperature. The increase of surface temperature can help us determine this disaster before it happens to prevent it, while the other sensors help to know the impact after it has happened. As a result, the observation of the tremor level shows high content in the temperature (0 to - 5), tremor level slight indication is at the temperature range of (10 to 15), minute observation of the tremor level has observed in the field of (25 to 30). The spatial modules help to validate the latitude and longitude derivatives to provide the Disaster prone area.
