TI  - Chemsex in Italy: Experiences of Men Who Have Sex With Men Consuming Illicit Drugs to Enhance and Prolong Their Sexual Activity
T2  - JOURNAL OF SEXUAL MEDICINE
LA  - English
KW  - Chemsex
KW  - Party and play
